      en: ["Founded in 1983 by Sharon Matola.", "Houses only animal species native to Belize.", "The facility covers an area of approximately 29 acres.", "Home to the Baird's tapir, the national animal of Belize.", "Operates a successful conservation program for jaguars.", "Located at Mile 29 on the George Price Highway."],
